  "authoring": {
    "summary": "Umbra Vacua 03 mirrors spiral approaches around circular asteroid barrages, then extends into alternating drone pressure and constrained cardinal asteroid streams.",
    "boss_replaces_signature_phase": false,
    "generation_notes": [
      "Open with five clockwise spiral entries every two seconds, advancing the entry angle by 15 degrees.",
      "After one second of silence, complete one clockwise circle with 20 fast asteroids over five seconds.",
      "After a two-second buffer, mirror the spiral pattern counterclockwise while sine drones cycle north, east, south, and west; place a circle shooter at the midpoint.",
      "Alternate shifters and fast drones across opposing axes for 10 seconds.",
      "After one second of silence, complete a counterclockwise fast-asteroid circle, add a circle shooter, and immediately complete a clockwise circle.",
      "After the circular finale, alternate shifters and fast drones for 10 seconds while spawning a size-26, one-HP circle shooter every three seconds.",
      "Follow with 10 seconds of slow cardinal asteroids whose direction never repeats either of the previous two entries.",
      "After a two-second buffer, repeat the constrained cardinal stream with fast asteroids for 10 seconds."
    ],
